OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CPakistan's first astronaut goes to     
OL,5,Cspace aboard Chinese rocket            
OL,6,FHis mission is expected to last for    
OL,7,Fseveral days before he returns to      
OL,8,FEarth on the Shenzhou-23.              
OL,10,FChina is racing against the US for     
OL,11,Fdominance in space. It brought back    
OL,12,Fthe first samples from the moon's far  
OL,13,Fside in 2024, and aims to land         
OL,14,Fastronauts on the moon by 2030..       
OL,22,                                   G2/2 
